          "quote": "(node (ref \"U6\") (pin \"9\") (pinfunction \"LAN_PORT2_RX+\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "5 column + 7 row lines wired directly to SKW92A GPIO pins"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "Keyboard matrix activity loads and can couple the Ethernet PHY signal pins; those pins are not shown as GPIO in the netlist, so the module may not be able to scan the keyboard correctly.",
      "confidence": 0.87
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The keyboard columns are connected to pins identified as Ethernet PHY signals, not GPIOs as the specification describes. This creates a likely functional conflict that can prevent reliable keyboard scanning."
}

